lue"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnicodeDecodingResult"},{"type":"text","text":" instance, representing the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unicode scalar, an indication of an error, or an indication that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"UTF sequence has been fully decoded."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To decode a code unit sequence completely, call this method repeatedly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until it returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnicodeDecodingResult.emptyInput"},{"type":"text","text":". Checking that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iterator was exhausted is not sufficient, because the decoder can store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffered data from the input iterator."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because of buffering, it is impossible to find the corresponding position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the iterator for a given returned "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Unicode.Scalar"},{"type":"text","text":" or an error."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example decodes the UTF-16 encoded bytes of a string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into an array of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Unicode.Scalar"},{"type":"text","text":" instances. This is a demonstration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only—if you need the Unicode scalar representation of a string, use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unicodeScalars"},{"type":"text","text":" view."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ UTF-32 representation of \"✨Unicode✨\"","let codeUnits: [UTF32.CodeU